    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d590">

                <pb facs="0700" n="602" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg602"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/3178: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Crane</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-01-12T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 12,
                                1921—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>18. Your 9, January 6, 7 p.m.<anchor n="43" xml:id="d590-f1"/> The Agreement is
                    the essential thing to be communicated whether by the Groups or by the
                    Legations, even though the question of communicating resolutions be held over
                    until unanimity can be reached among those interested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
